le: We could see the peaks of the mountains from the bus.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in an advertisement.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wetlands", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area that is covered by shallow water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The interior of the country has forests and wetlands.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to possess", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have or own", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you know that Greece possesses thousands of islands?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to island hop", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move from one island to another", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Use our boat to island hop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "archipelago", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of islands", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Greece has an archipelago of about 3,000 islands.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "picturesque", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very pretty or charming             ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Walk through picturesque mountain trails.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "steep", "type": "name"}, {"content": "rising or falling very sharply ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The steep cliffs were incredible.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "catamaran", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a boat with two hulls   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We took a catamaran to a nearby island.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Short u and Long o sound", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "How to pronounce the short u sound:<br/> <ul><li>The body of the tongue is relaxed and low in the mouth. </li><li>You touch the sides of your tongue to the bottom teeth.  </li><li>Your jaw and lips are relaxed.  </li><li>This sound is commonly used for the pronunciation of the vowel sound of an unstressed syllable. </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How to pronounce the long o sound:<br/> <ul><li>The long o sound vowel ends in a small w sound. </li><li>The tongue is pushed back between the bottom teeth and you can feel them along the sides of the tongue.  </li><li>The sound moves into a w sound by raising the jaw while closing the lips into a small circle.  </li><li>The tongue moves upward until the tongue is near the back of the top of the mouth. </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Short u sound: won, brother, from, none", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Long o sound: phone, home, tone, roast", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Read the table aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine you are on a tour of Greece.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Create a 8-10 line dialogue that uses 3 words from each column.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you are unsure of the meaning of a word, look it up in a dictionary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Short <span class=\\\"italic\\\">U</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hum, hull, gull, dumb, cut, cup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Long <span class=\\\"italic\\\">O</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"home, hole, goal, dome, coat, cope\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I say and use minimal pairs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Go on the trip of a lifetime! You won't want to come home!</p>"}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "4000", "id": 2, "text": "Join us on our incredible land and sea, 10-day tour of Greece.  The tour begins with an introduction to Greece's spectacular landscape including a drive over the high, steep peaks and canyons of the country's interior. You will be led to the lakes and wetlands of the western border. Island hop on our catamaran and discover all the excitement and relaxation you need during your holidays."}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob04re2img03.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 3, "text": "Did you know that Greece possesses an archipelago of about 3,000 islands? Greece is the best destination to lay under the hot sun. You can run along exotic beaches, walk through picturesque mountain trails, see magical sunsets and visit ancient sites from long ago. It is a fun, friendly and fabulous place to make memories.</p>Phone our office today!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le05ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can use and compare the short u and long o sound.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about geographic features.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can identify key information in a short audio.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What was the last good story or anecdote that you heard?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you prefer listening to funny or scary stories?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronuncation Spot: A Holiday in Greece", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct